{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"shot\": 1,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他想起曾经亲近的日子，心里重新暖起来，也有了把以后过好、不再纠缠过去的劲头。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"温暖、振作、盼望，夹着一点害怕失去亲近的担忧。\",\n      \"missed\": \"紫色句中“怕很久才遇见亲近的人”的不安，以及绿色句中“即使没有，也好好过、不为留人委屈”的自我安顿，需要读完整才能充分抓到。粉色音乐描述的具体画面也不容易一眼全部接收。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 2,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他回想曾经亲近的日子而重新获得动力，想把往后的生活过好，同时开始面对可能很久才再遇见亲近之人的担忧。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"温暖、兴奋、有劲头，伴随不安和逐渐平静。\",\n      \"missed\": \"新增的“269–280快速八度明亮炫目，像被气流推着跑，兴奋得喘不过气”需要读小字才能完整理解；紫色和绿色两块中的条件、转折及自我态度也不容易同时抓全。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 3,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他从回忆亲近的日子中重新获得暖意和动力，担心以后难再遇到亲近的人，但最终选择珍惜真正的亲近，同时不再委屈自己。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"温暖、兴奋、忐忑、渐渐平静、释然、自持。\",\n      \"missed\": \"紫色下方关于冲势收敛、不安和终于能喘口气的细节，以及绿色下方低音退去、高音孤悬、结尾可能意味着决定或梦醒等描述，都需要逐句读。尤其绿色小字信息层次较多，一眼难以辨认哪些是声音描写，哪些是人物情绪的对应。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    }\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3,\n  \"link\": 3,\n  \"main_problem\": \"三条大字都接近主标题级别，篇幅也都较长，缺少一个明显统领全屏的核心句；到第三张又逐步叠加多行音乐细节。人物经历和感受本身是连贯的，但音乐画面与人物处境之间的对应关系需要观众自己再拼一次，容易出现抓到了不少关键词，却没有一下形成完整印象的情况。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "9af4d44d-3a22-4b56-8257-82f68c908cbf", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T004516564328Z", "elapsed_seconds": 66.782, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T00:46:23.348205+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "7a8708a7ac84125edbf2ba6fb42895b51b4acf08ca27246ac99477ae154dd873", "attachment_count": 3}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 3, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T004516564328Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "a606094de8aa698b69ec919c967fff9c5dc9b38a43570f54c8074992a8e97526"}}}
